Alongside the UI and visual design, the redesign also renewed the underlying technology of the car search.

Together with the team, we went through click data and heatmaps to understand how people actually used the search and which filters they relied on most. Based on these findings, I conceptualized and designed a new structure and wireframe for the search, bringing the most-used filters to the top so that the most common needs were the first thing users saw.

Design and technical production worked in close collaboration throughout the project, delivering a result that pleased the client and met their expectations. The numbers backed this up: after the launch, the engagement rate **rose** from 85.8% to 89.1%.
